    "sections": {
        "description": "Tour Manager Theme offers a structured design suitable for displaying travel packages, destination information, schedules, and booking-related content. The layout includes sections for featured tours, galleries, pricing details, testimonials, blogs, and inquiry forms. Responsive design support allows the website to adapt across different screen sizes and devices. The theme includes customization settings for colors, fonts, headers, banners, and homepage sections. It supports widget areas, navigation menus, and standard content formats for flexible website management. Compatibility with page builder plugins allows easier editing and layout adjustments without extensive coding. Additional functionality includes SEO-friendly markup, translation support, social media integration, and organized inner page templates. The theme is also compatible with contact form plugins and image gallery features for presenting travel-related content clearly. Built-in customization options help manage layouts and styling while maintaining consistent performance. The overall design focuses on providing a simple and organized structure for tour listings, destination pages, and informational content without relying on overly complex visual elements or unnecessary features."
    },
